    - weigh one-tenth as much
  - Use a polearm
    - It will corrode.
    - You won't corrode.
    - Stand two squares away horizontally or vertically
      - 'a'pply the polearm
      - move the cursor to the monster
      - hit '.'
      - Repeat
  - Rustproof all armor/weapons.
  - Wear an apron (aka alchemist's smock).  
    - Gives acid resistance.
    - Knights on the Quest take note.


